## Keputusan Arsitektur Kunci

| Keputusan | Detail |
|---|---|
| **RBAC** | Berbasis tabel (`roles`, `permissions`, `role_permissions`, `user_roles`), bukan enum |
| **Database PK** | UUID v4 (`@default(uuid())`) — stabil untuk MVP |
| **Schema** | Single-file `schema.prisma` — modularisasi ditunda |
| **Prisma v7** | Menggunakan Driver Adapter (`@prisma/adapter-pg`) |
| **Auth** | Credentials Provider (Email/Password) dengan bcrypt |
| **Middleware** | Session-check saja di Edge; RBAC mendalam via `authorize()` di Server Action |
| **No Repository** | Route → Service → Prisma (langsung) |
| **Soft Delete** | `deletedAt` pada User, Ticket, dan Master Data |

